      "description": "Careers at CSU | Cleveland State University Skip to main content Main navigation About CSU At a Glance Concerned Vikes Free Speech at CSU President's Office Admissions Undergraduate Graduate International Law Online CampusNet Financial Aid and Scholarships Tuition and Fees Pre-College Programs Academics Academic Calendar Colleges Majors Blackboard Login Workforce Development Syllabus Library Athletics Give Research Office of Research Sponsored Programs and Research Services Technology Transfer Faculty Web Profiles Library Research Centers Search this site Search About CSU At a Glance Concerned Vikes Free Speech at CSU President's Office Admissions Undergraduate Graduate International Law Online CampusNet Financial Aid and Scholarships Tuition and Fees Pre-College Programs Academics Academic Calendar Colleges Majors Blackboard Login Workforce Development Syllabus Library Athletics Give Research Office of Research Sponsored Programs and Research Services Technology Transfer Faculty Web Profiles Library Research Centers A-Z Index Alumni Career Services Disability Resources Military and Veterans Parking Recreation Services Residence Life Viking Outfitters Breadcrumb Home Human Resources Careers At CSU Human Resources Careers at CSU Volunteer Benefits at a Glance Employee Experience and Labor Relations VikeHealth and Well-Being VikeHealth Grand Rounds Past Grand Rounds Events VikeHealth and Wellbeing Monthly Wellness Updates Rewards and Recognition Distinguished Staff Awards Service Awards 2026 Service Awards 2025 Service Awards 2023 Service Awards 2022 Service Awards 2021 Service Awards 2020 Service Awards 2019 United Vision Thrive Award Human Resources Human Resources Careers at CSU Volunteer Benefits at a Glance Employee Experience and Labor Relations VikeHealth and Well-Being VikeHealth Grand Rounds Past Grand Rounds Events VikeHealth and Wellbeing Monthly Wellness Updates Rewards and Recognition Distinguished Staff Awards Service Awards 2026 Service Awards 2025 Service Awards 2023 Service Awards 2022 Service Awards 2021 Service Awards 2020 Service Awards 2019 United Vision Thrive Award Contact Information Mailing Address Cleveland State University 2121 Euclid Avenue, AC 113 Cleveland, OH 44115-2214 Campus Location Parker Hannifin Administration Center 2300 Euclid Avenue Suite 113 Phone: 216.687.3636 Fax: 216.687.9334 hr@csuohio.edu Careers at CSU Faculty and Staff Job Postings Apply now! arrow_right_alt Handshake Internships and Jobs (Students and Alumni) Apply now! arrow_right_alt On-Campus Student Employment Apply now! arrow_right_alt Join Our Team Cleveland State University has been awarded Forbes America’s Best Employers, and also ranked by US News as one of the best colleges in national universities. With over 500 faculty and 1,000 staff, Cleveland State University strives to live out our vision to aspire being the national leader in social and economic mobility and a great place to learn and work. Some Benefits of a Career with Cleveland State University! We are Cleveland’s University A beautiful urban campus setting in the heart of downtown Cleveland Ohio Daily living our values to collaborate with community, serve students and unleash creativity Comprehensive healthcare benefits Comprehensive paid time off benefits Tuition benefits for employees and dependents Additional professional development opportunities 14% employer contribution to public pension plans (OPERS/STRS) Focus on work-life-balance and wellbeing Many, many, more! Cleveland State University (CSU) is an Equal Opportunity Employer! CSU is committed to offering equal opportunities to all qualified applicants and employees, regardless of race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, national origin, age, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Phone: 216-687-3636 Email: hr@csuohio.edu Contact Information Mailing Address Cleveland State University 2121 Euclid Avenue, AC 113 Cleveland, OH 44115-2214 Campus Location Parker Hannifin Administration Center 2300 Euclid Avenue Suite 113 Phone: 216.687.3636 Fax: 216.687.9334 hr@csuohio.edu 2121 Euclid Avenue Cleveland, Ohio 44115 (216) 687-2000 We are CSU Campus E-mail Campus Map Directory Employment Events (Vikes Connect) Free Speech at CSU Student resources MYCSU Care Management Dining Services Report a concern Residence Life Student Advising ©2026 Cleveland State University Web Privacy Statement Non-Discrimination Statement Tobacco Free Accessibility"
