    "https://www.csuohio.edu/career-development-exploration/campus-student-employment": {
      "title": "Office of Student Employment",
      "description": "Office of Student Employment | Cleveland State University Skip to main content Main navigation About CSU At a Glance Concerned Vikes Free Speech at CSU President's Office Admissions Undergraduate Graduate International Law Online CampusNet Financial Aid and Scholarships Tuition and Fees Pre-College Programs Academics Academic Calendar Colleges Majors Blackboard Login Workforce Development Syllabus Library Athletics Give Research Office of Research Sponsored Programs and Research Services Technology Transfer Faculty Web Profiles Library Research Centers Search this site Search About CSU At a Glance Concerned Vikes Free Speech at CSU President's Office Admissions Undergraduate Graduate International Law Online CampusNet Financial Aid and Scholarships Tuition and Fees Pre-College Programs Academics Academic Calendar Colleges Majors Blackboard Login Workforce Development Syllabus Library Athletics Give Research Office of Research Sponsored Programs and Research Services Technology Transfer Faculty Web Profiles Library Research Centers A-Z Index Alumni Career Services Disability Resources Military and Veterans Parking Recreation Services Residence Life Viking Outfitters Breadcrumb Home Career Development & Exploration Office of Student Employment Career Development & Exploration Division of Student Belonging and Success Students Employers Alumni Faculty Pre-Professional Programs Office of Student Employment Students Designees/Supervisors Our Events Our Team Visitor Directions & Parking Career Development & Exploration Career Development & Exploration Division of Student Belonging and Success Students Employers Alumni Faculty Pre-Professional Programs Office of Student Employment Students Designees/Supervisors Our Events Our Team Visitor Directions & Parking Information Office Hours Mon – Fri 9:00 am – 5:00 pm Mailing Address and Campus Location 1899 E 22nd Street. Berkman Hall 116 Cleveland, OH 44115 careers@csuohio.edu Welcome to the Office of Student Employment The Office of Student Employment is dedicated to supporting student success through meaningful work experiences that enhance learning, build professional skills, and foster career readiness. We serve as the central resource for all on-campus and approved off-campus employment opportunities for enrolled students. Our office connects students with part-time \"At-Will\" employment opportunities that promote personal and professional development, while also supporting the operational needs of the university. We work closely with campus departments, community partners, and federal work-study programs to ensure that students gain valuable experience in a supportive and inclusive environment. Whether you're looking for your first campus job, exploring work-study eligibility, or navigating hiring and payroll processes, our team is here to guide you every step of the way. From job search resources and resume support to supervisor training and employment compliance, we are committed to making student employment a rewarding and enriching part of your college experience. Join us in empowering the next generation of student leaders—one job at a time. Important Minimum Wage Update Poster Ohio’s minimum wage increased effective January 1, 2026. • Non-tipped employees have increased to a minimum of $11.00 per hour. • Tipped employees have increased to $5.50 per hour, plus tips. Student Employment Office Contact Information Email: studentemploy@csuohio.edu Students Resources for Students arrow_right_alt Designees/Supervisors Resources for Supervisors arrow_right_alt Information Office Hours Mon – Fri 9:00 am – 5:00 pm Mailing Address and Campus Location 1899 E 22nd Street. Berkman Hall 116 Cleveland, OH 44115 careers@csuohio.edu 2121 Euclid Avenue Cleveland, Ohio 44115 (216) 687-2000 We are CSU Campus E-mail Campus Map Directory Employment Events (Vikes Connect) Free Speech at CSU Student resources MYCSU Care Management Dining Services Report a concern Residence Life 